<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Devon Energy cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Devon Energy cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said it downgraded Devon Energy Corp to attractive from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Devon Energy lost 7/8 to 40-7/8.</p>
</text>
